   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "4mT89K6PpYj5QRKx0f6RZC",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "We need bold, strong politics to cut through the chaos we're collectively facing. Whether it be cost of living or climate chaos, incremental changes won't work. Empowering citizens to collectively and meaningfully participate in the democratic process is key to creating the systemic changes at governance level that will allow us to both confront and change the political and economic systems that are killing our planet. Our current system is medieval. Together better alternatives happen!"
     },
     {
      "_key": "4mT89K6PpYj5QRKx0f6Rb7",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "My extensive involvement with social and environmental issues has given me insight into the challenges that we are now all facing. As a past Northland Regional Councillor I understand governance, how it's not fit for purpose, how it needs to change! Non-violence, transparency, inclusiveness and responsibility are principles that guide me, personally and politically. I enjoy robust, evidence-based dialogue, guided by available science and speak my mind regardless of consequence, without fear or favour."
     },
     {
      "_key": "4mT89K6PpYj5QRKx0f6Rd2",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Massive rooftop solar + battery rollout creating employment and lowering your electricity prices."
     },
     {
      "_key": "4mT89K6PpYj5QRKx0f6Rex",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Create 1000 Jobs for Nature for DOC to give young people training and meaningful employment"
     },
     {
      "_key": "4mT89K6PpYj5QRKx0f6Rgs",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Storm-proof roads connecting all towns to Whangarei and South, rebuilding rail for the heavy loads"
     }
    ],
